@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records

### Record detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/1

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/search?q=policy

### Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/search?category=Policy

### Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/search?status=Active

### Year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/search?year=2026

### Combined search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/search?q=digital&category=Policy&status=Active

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records?page=0&size=1

### Create a disposable example; copy its returned id into the requests below
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Example Student Research Scheme",
  "category": "Scheme",
  "department": "Student Welfare",
  "referenceNumber": "EXAMPLE/SCH/2026/001",
  "publicationYear": 2026,
  "status": "Draft",
  "keywords": "research,students"
}

### Replace created example (set createdId first)
@createdId = 0
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{createdId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Revised Student Research Scheme",
  "category": "Scheme",
  "department": "Student Welfare",
  "referenceNumber": "EXAMPLE/SCH/2026/001",
  "publicationYear": 2026,
  "status": "Active"
}

### Delete created example
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{createdId}}

### Validation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: application/json

{}
